# Extra commands that put comments in front of a reviewer, one extended regex
# per line, matched against the Bash command. `git commit` is built into
# comment-ratio-gate.py and does not belong here.
#
# Copy to `comment-ratio-triggers` and add your own. That name is gitignored:
# a review-posting command names an employer's toolchain, and this hook is
# published.
#
# \bgh\s+pr\s+create\b
# \barc\s+diff\b
